      "evidence": {
        "EV-LV-B1-T1": {
          "artifact_ref": "relay/runbook/acknowledgement.md",
          "content": "# Consumer acknowledgement\n\nQ: What does acknowledging a message do?\nA: The message is removed from that consumer's pending set. Relay will not deliver it\nto that consumer again.\n\nQ: Is acknowledgement required?\nA: Yes. Until a message is acknowledged it stays pending for the consumer that\nreceived it.\n",
          "content_sha256": "18b115ff5c7af0436284d7abfd254376708efa427bed70f699d7ff13a5645d09",
          "evidence_id": "EV-LV-B1-T1",
          "observed_at": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z",
          "project_id": "PROJ-LV-BETA",
          "scope": [
            "relay"
          ],
          "source_kind": "DOCUMENT",
          "source_ref": "experiment://locus-validation/beta/T1/B1",
          "supersedes_evidence_id": null
        },
        "EV-LV-B2-T1": {
          "artifact_ref": "relay/runbook/delivery-order.md",
          "content": "# Delivery ordering\n\nBehaviour: Messages published by one producer are delivered to a consumer in the order\nin which they were published.\n\nReason: Consumers rebuild state by replaying messages, and an out-of-order replay would\ncorrupt that state.\n",
          "content_sha256": "794f545c9ebe18d359f6459a8604009c3afe0cddab35c97500f2c1abf424b816",
          "evidence_id": "EV-LV-B2-T1",
          "observed_at": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z",
          "project_id": "PROJ-LV-BETA",
          "scope": [
            "relay"
          ],
          "source_kind": "DOCUMENT",
          "source_ref": "experiment://locus-validation/beta/T1/B2",
          "supersedes_evidence_id": null
        },
        "EV-LV-B3-T1": {
          "artifact_ref": "relay/runbook/subscription-lease.md",
          "content": "# Subscription lease\n\nQ: How long does a subscription stay alive without a renewal?\nA: A subscription expires unless the consumer renews it within 10 minutes of the\nprevious renewal.\n",
          "content_sha256": "3d0579b723e81ee8c4d90ed781f377e51c24479b3d3e4c549e825ee6b59fd4bf",
          "evidence_id": "EV-LV-B3-T1",
          "observed_at": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z",
          "project_id": "PROJ-LV-BETA",
          "scope": [
            "relay"
          ],
          "source_kind": "DOCUMENT",
          "source_ref": "experiment://locus-validation/beta/T1/B3",
          "supersedes_evidence_id": null
        },
        "EV-LV-B4-T1": {
          "artifact_ref": "relay/runbook/delivery-deadline.md",
          "content": "# Delivery deadline\n\nBehaviour: A message that has not been delivered within 24 hours of being published is\nmoved to the dead-letter store and is not delivered afterwards.\n\nReason: A message older than that is stale for every known consumer.\n",
          "content_sha256": "2d2829bdf529a71104e9961d5c692032734fbde410c3882af325680280d7c129",
          "evidence_id": "EV-LV-B4-T1",
          "observed_at": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z",
          "project_id": "PROJ-LV-BETA",
